  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation of modern classrooms of foreign languages</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Creation of modern classrooms of foreign languages</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Mikrogrant je zameran&#xfd; na rekon&#x161;trukciu a moderniz&#xe1;ciu u&#x10d;ebne cudz&#xed;ch jazykov na gymn&#xe1;ziu v obci Dovhe. Z mikrograntu sa pl&#xe1;nuje financova&#x165; rekon&#x161;trukcia elektrickej siete v u&#x10d;ebni, zak&#xfa;penie nov&#xe9;ho n&#xe1;bytku, didaktick&#xfd;ch pom&#xf4;cok a elektroniky (notebooky, projektor, interakt&#xed;vna tabu&#x13e;a, audio, at&#x10f;.).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on the reconstruction and modernization of a foreign language classroom at a grammar school in Dovhe, Ukraine. The project will support the reconstruction of the electrical grid, procurement of new furniture, teaching tools and electronic devices (PCs, interactive board, audio devices, etc.).</narrative>
  </description>
